# TIN TROOP 3-B, start to finish with plain button presses (recorded once
# from a route plan). The laser eye fires down the tunnel at anything in
# its line, so a stone dropped right in front of it (from the air, above
# the beam) blinds it. The second soldier drops in on the tin ram, jumps
# its charge, and lances it in the back while it's dazed against the crate.
game tintroop
wait 5
cheat unlock
press A
wait 5
press LEFT
press LEFT
press A
wait 30
press A
wait 5
wait 129
hold RIGHT 170
hold RIGHT+A 14
wait 13
hold RIGHT+A 11
hold DOWN+B 2
wait 41
hold RIGHT 105
wait 31
hold RIGHT+A 16
wait 11
hold RIGHT 247
hold RIGHT+A 16
wait 5
hold RIGHT 16
wait 177
hold RIGHT+A 24
wait 73
hold RIGHT+A 30
wait 33
hold LEFT 2
hold B 2
wait 185
hold RIGHT 31
hold RIGHT+A 16
wait 5
hold RIGHT 18
hold RIGHT+A 20
wait 17
hold RIGHT 262
hold RIGHT+A 34
hold RIGHT 300
expect state == 4
expect best_7 == 12
expect kills == 1
